T.C. May asks if we feel the way he does concerning conversation vs. electronic
mail forum for discussion.  In general I do as well.  I learned the 'art' of
conversation from my parents (only child, no friends) who didn't speak if they
didn't have something to say.  If I'm visiting them, I love to talk.  We sit in
a room for several hours and get more said than I ever get from this list in
the same amount of time (or any list.)  But even still, most of the time no one
