severe hinderance.  I think that talking with most people is worthless and
frustrating because we prefer different conversational rules and techniques (I
can see the weather for myself, why discuss it?)  If I'm conversing with
people who are comfortable with a little silence between speakers, personal
conversation is much more powerfull than electronic conversation.

